{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"Persistence Middleware","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"abstract":[{"text":"Configure automatic persistence that drains entity changes and batches database writes.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is configured with one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/StateWriter","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" per "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["PersistencePlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","    writers: [","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.items) { writes, deletes in","            for item in writes { try? await db.upsert(item) }","            for id in deletes  { try? await db.delete(id: id) }","        },","    ],","    debounce: .milliseconds(250)  \/\/ Default; configurable",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"afterReduce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is called automatically through the plugin lifecycle — no manual invocation needed. Register the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginHost","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and pass it to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documen